OL,3,ARussian strike on buses kills 33, say
OL,4,Aofficials, as deadly attacks on Ukraine
OL,5,Asurge
OL,6,
OL,7,FThirty-three people have been killed in
OL,8,Fa Russian glide bomb attack on two
OL,9,Fcivilian buses in the frontline city of
OL,10,FKramatorsk, rescue officials say.
OL,12,FAnother 18 people were wounded, said
OL,13,FDonetsk regional head Vadym Filashkin,
OL,14,Faccusing Russia of targeting buses
OL,15,Fcarrying passengers to kill as many
OL,16,Fcivilians as possible.
OL,18,FImages posted by local prosecutors
OL,19,Fshowed the burning metal shell of the
OL,20,Fbus along with debris and some of the
OL,21,Fvictims on the road.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
