OL,3,ARussian strike on buses kills 33, say
OL,4,Aofficials, as deadly attacks on Ukraine
OL,5,Asurge
OL,6,
OL,7,FKramatorsk and neighbouring Slovyansk
OL,8,Fare part of a so-called fortress belt
OL,9,Fthat Russia is trying to seize as part
OL,10,Fof Vladimir Putin's claim to the entire
OL,11,FUkrainian industrial region of Donbas.
